Release checklist for MiMi-d

- Verify all patches present in Presets/manifest.ttl
  (run ../Utils/find-missing-presets.sh)
- Verify debug parameters are disabled in ParamDefs.h
- Update version number in manual (manual version and plugin version)
- Create .pdf of manual
- Copy manual .pdf to butoba.net/downloads
- Update version number in DistrhoPluginInfo.h (was MiMi-d.c:getVersion)
- Set git tag and push to repo
